  "name": "luh-maturity-based-process-model-for-research-data-management-in-engineering-research-projects",
  "notes": "This data set contains the process visualization using BPMN of a research project.\r\nThe focus is on the interaction between research activities and data management activities.\r\n\r\nIn addition, defined process areas are visualized with a maturity model integration. This shows the activities at the data management level in relation to their influence on the maturity model.\r\n\r\nThe maturity models are available at: http://maturitymodel.nfdi4ing.de/\r\n\r\n",
